いバニーガールの服を着て、タイツを履いて欲しいです。背中は開いていてほしい。\n\nミカヤはこのポーズでお願いします。https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/104666049\n\nミカヤの胸の大きさはこれくらいにしてほしい。https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/105459215\n\nミカヤに青いヘアリボンをつけてほしい。\n\n幸せそうな顔をお願いします。\n\nその他はお任せします。\n\nミカヤの参考写真です:\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/96426757\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/73650830\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/71616949\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/LYc9tAL\n\nNice to meet you!\n\nI want you to draw Micaiah from Fire Emblem.\n\nI want Micaiah to wear a black bunny girl outfit with tights. The back of the outfit should be open. \n\nI want Micaiah to have this pose. https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/104666049\n\nI want Micaiah's breasts to be this size. https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/105459215\n\nPlease have Micaiah wear her blue hair ribbon\n\nPlease give her a happy face.\n\nEverything else is up to you. \n\nMicaiah reference photos: linked above", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aki_Mai_2165/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2590423, "client_id": 1934423, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/252ce1d4/uploads/origins/c676c411-3fca-4ae3-a104-52a9b41752c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2763b06696b65b6f5ecb9384c9b9015e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/252ce1d4/uploads/origins/c676c411-3fca-4ae3-a104-52a9b41752c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2763b06696b65b6f5ecb9384c9b9015e, https://si.imgix.net/252ce1d4/uploads/origins/c676c411-3fca-4ae3-a104-52a9b41752c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c82c9a4c357cb344f2b4eb4929950453 2x, https://si.imgix.net/252ce1d4/uploads/origins/c676c411-3fca-4ae3-a104-52a9b41752c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d63414305133b6cfc8c381